1
00:00:01,341 --> 00:00:03,384
GIRL: Water.

2
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,428
Earth.

3
00:00:05,553 --> 00:00:07,514
Fire.

4
00:00:07,639 --> 00:00:10,266
Air.

5
00:00:10,391 --> 00:00:14,103
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:14,229 --> 00:00:18,775
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:18,858 --> 00:00:21,778
Only the Avatar, master of
all four elements, could stop them.

8
00:00:21,861 --> 00:00:26,241
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

9
00:00:26,324 --> 00:00:30,078
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

10
00:00:30,161 --> 00:00:31,829
an airbender named Aang.

11
00:00:31,913 --> 00:00:34,374
And although his
airbending skills are great,

12
00:00:34,499 --> 00:00:36,709
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

13
00:00:36,793 --> 00:00:37,877
AANG: Oof!

14
00:00:37,961 --> 00:00:40,755
But I believe Aang can save the world.

15
00:00:47,136 --> 00:00:49,764
MAN: Previously on Avatar...

16
00:00:49,889 --> 00:00:52,308
Don't you know fans
just make flame stronger?

17
00:00:55,979 --> 00:00:58,189
I am Long Feng, head of the Dai Li.

18
00:00:58,314 --> 00:01:00,149
Why won't you let us talk to the king?

19
00:01:00,275 --> 00:01:03,653
The Earth King has no time to
get involved with political squabbles.

20
00:01:03,778 --> 00:01:05,822
So the king is just a figurehead?

21
00:01:05,947 --> 00:01:07,407
He's your puppet!

22
00:01:08,324 --> 00:01:10,994
It's time for you to look inward,

23
00:01:11,119 --> 00:01:14,080
and begin asking yourself
the big questions.

24
00:01:14,205 --> 00:01:15,582
Who are you?

25
00:01:16,207 --> 00:01:17,333
And what do you want?

26
00:01:18,042 --> 00:01:20,295
I can handle you by myself.

27
00:01:20,587 --> 00:01:23,256
( RUMBLING )

28
00:01:23,381 --> 00:01:25,049
I missed you, buddy.

29
00:01:36,686 --> 00:01:40,607
I missed you more than
you'll ever know, buddy.

30
00:01:40,732 --> 00:01:43,776
( LAUGHING )

31
00:01:43,901 --> 00:01:46,571
Look, we escaped from
the Dai Li, we got Appa back,

32
00:01:46,654 --> 00:01:50,158
I'm telling you, we should go to
the Earth King now and tell him our plan.

33
00:01:50,241 --> 00:01:51,618
We're on a roll.

34
00:01:51,743 --> 00:01:54,495
One good hour after weeks of
trouble isn't much of a roll.

35
00:01:54,621 --> 00:01:55,622
We can build on it.

36
00:01:55,705 --> 00:01:58,708
If we want to invade
the Fire Nation when the eclipse happens,

37
00:01:58,791 --> 00:02:00,376
we need the Earth King's support.

38
00:02:00,460 --> 00:02:02,545
What makes you think we'll get it?

39
00:02:02,670 --> 00:02:04,172
I don't know if you've noticed,

40
00:02:04,255 --> 00:02:07,216
but things don't usually go that
smoothly for our little gang.

41
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:09,510
I know, but I've got
a good feeling about this.

42
00:02:09,594 --> 00:02:10,845
This time'll be different.

43
00:02:10,928 --> 00:02:12,930
Sokka, Long Feng is in control
of the city.

44
00:02:13,014 --> 00:02:16,267
His conspiracy with the Dai Li
is too powerful.

45
00:02:16,351 --> 00:02:19,937
I think we should just keep flying and
leave this horrible place behind us.

46
00:02:20,021 --> 00:02:23,650
I'm with sweetness.
I've seen enough of Ba Sing Se.

47
00:02:23,775 --> 00:02:26,361
And I can't even see!

48
00:02:26,444 --> 00:02:27,945
But now that we have Appa back,

49
00:02:28,029 --> 00:02:31,157
there's nothing stopping us from telling
the Earth King the truth.

50
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,825
About the conspiracy and the war.

51
00:02:32,909 --> 00:02:34,535
See, Aang's with me.

52
00:02:34,661 --> 00:02:38,873
It's the whole reason we came here in
the first place, we have to try.

53
00:02:38,998 --> 00:02:42,669
Well, I guess if the Earth King
knew the truth,

54
00:02:42,794 --> 00:02:44,962
things could change.

55
00:02:45,088 --> 00:02:48,216
I don't trust the new positive Sokka.

56
00:02:48,341 --> 00:02:51,010
( SHOUTING ) Long Feng
brainwashed you, didn't he?

57
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:58,226
That's probably the Dai Li
searching for us, so?

58
00:02:59,602 --> 00:03:00,812
Let's fly.

59
00:03:00,937 --> 00:03:05,108
( ROARING )

60
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:07,777
Can we please buy a new saddle?

61
00:03:07,902 --> 00:03:09,779
Riding bareback is terrifying.

62
00:03:12,490 --> 00:03:13,783
There it is.

63
00:03:13,866 --> 00:03:15,368
That whole thing is the palace.

64
00:03:15,451 --> 00:03:17,745
The Earth King's chamber
should be in the center.

65
00:03:17,829 --> 00:03:18,913
We have to be careful.

66
00:03:18,996 --> 00:03:21,582
Long Feng's probably warned
the king that we're coming.

67
00:03:21,666 --> 00:03:23,251
SOKKA: why would you assume that?

68
00:03:23,334 --> 00:03:26,421
If you ask me, I think we're
just gonna sail right... ( SCREAMING )

69
00:03:26,504 --> 00:03:28,047
- APPA: ( RUMBLING )
- What was that?

70
00:03:28,131 --> 00:03:29,465
SOKKA: Surface-to-air rocks!

71
00:03:29,549 --> 00:03:30,633
More incoming!

72
00:03:30,758 --> 00:03:31,759
( SCREAMING )

73
00:03:43,438 --> 00:03:45,022
AANG: ( GRUNTING )

74
00:03:53,072 --> 00:03:57,952
( SOLDIERS GRUNTING AND SCREAMING )

75
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:01,873
( GROWLING )

76
00:04:21,434 --> 00:04:24,604
( SOLDIERS SCREAMING )

77
00:04:24,687 --> 00:04:27,023
KATARA: Sorry!

78
00:04:27,648 --> 00:04:28,649
( SOLDIERS SCREAMING )

79
00:04:32,153 --> 00:04:35,782
( SCREAMING )

80
00:04:35,865 --> 00:04:38,951
KATARA: Sorry, we just
need to get through to see the Earth King.

81
00:04:42,955 --> 00:04:44,332
( SOLDIERS GRUNTING )

82
00:05:00,139 --> 00:05:01,474
( SCREAMING )

83
00:05:04,018 --> 00:05:05,478
( SCREAMING )

84
00:05:07,313 --> 00:05:09,357
( GRUNTING )

85
00:05:22,119 --> 00:05:23,329
( SCREAMING )

86
00:05:27,458 --> 00:05:31,504
( SOLDIERS SCREAMING )

87
00:05:31,587 --> 00:05:34,340
SOKKA: Seriously, we're actually
on your guys' side!

88
00:05:36,259 --> 00:05:37,260
Sorry.

89
00:05:44,058 --> 00:05:45,518
SOKKA: In there.

90
00:05:45,601 --> 00:05:46,602
APPA: ( RUMBLING )

91
00:05:52,191 --> 00:05:54,277
( GRUNTING )

92
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,070
Toph, which way to the Earth King?

93
00:05:56,153 --> 00:05:57,613
How should I know?

94
00:05:57,697 --> 00:05:59,699
I'm still voting we leave Ba Sing Se.

95
00:06:00,992 --> 00:06:02,618
SOLDIERS: Whoa!

96
00:06:05,705 --> 00:06:06,998
( SOLDIER SCREAMING )

97
00:06:09,208 --> 00:06:10,459
Burglar!

98
00:06:10,543 --> 00:06:12,003
Sorry, wrong door.

99
00:06:18,593 --> 00:06:21,012
You did the right thing.

100
00:06:21,137 --> 00:06:23,139
Letting the Avatar's bison go free.

101
00:06:23,431 --> 00:06:25,641
I don't feel right.

102
00:06:30,104 --> 00:06:33,691
( GROANING )

103
00:06:33,774 --> 00:06:34,775
Zuko!

104
00:06:42,074 --> 00:06:43,868
SOKKA: Now that's an impressive door.

105
00:06:43,951 --> 00:06:45,411
It's gotta go somewhere.

106
00:06:46,579 --> 00:06:48,080
( SCREAMING ) Yah!

107
00:06:50,541 --> 00:06:53,294
( GRUNTING )

108
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:58,549
A little warning, next time?

109
00:07:07,475 --> 00:07:09,310
We need to talk to you.

110
00:07:09,393 --> 00:07:11,938
They're here to overthrow you.

111
00:07:12,021 --> 00:07:13,606
No, we're on your side.

112
00:07:13,689 --> 00:07:14,732
We're here to help.

113
00:07:14,857 --> 00:07:16,192
You have to trust us.

114
00:07:16,275 --> 00:07:17,693
You invade my palace,

115
00:07:17,818 --> 00:07:19,195
lay waste to all my guards,

116
00:07:19,278 --> 00:07:20,655
break down my fancy door,

117
00:07:20,780 --> 00:07:23,658
and you expect me to trust you?

118
00:07:23,783 --> 00:07:25,326
He has a good point.

119
00:07:25,451 --> 00:07:27,161
KING: If you're on my side,

120
00:07:27,286 --> 00:07:29,747
then drop your weapons and stand down.

121
00:07:36,170 --> 00:07:39,423
See, we're friends, Your Earthiness.

122
00:07:39,507 --> 00:07:41,008
( LAUGHING NERVOUSLY )

123
00:07:43,552 --> 00:07:44,804
( GRUNTING )

124
00:07:52,979 --> 00:07:54,563
LONG FENG: Detain the assailants.

125
00:07:57,274 --> 00:07:59,110
But we dropped our weapons.

126
00:07:59,193 --> 00:08:00,653
We're your allies!

127
00:08:00,736 --> 00:08:05,074
Make sure the Avatar and his friends
never see daylight again.

128
00:08:05,157 --> 00:08:06,534
The Avatar?

129
00:08:06,617 --> 00:08:08,202
You're the Avatar?

130
00:08:08,285 --> 00:08:10,162
Uh, no, him.

131
00:08:10,246 --> 00:08:11,455
Over here.

132
00:08:11,539 --> 00:08:13,708
LONG FENG: What does it matter,
Your Highness?

133
00:08:13,791 --> 00:08:15,209
They're enemies of the state.

134
00:08:15,668 --> 00:08:18,254
Perhaps you're right.

135
00:08:18,337 --> 00:08:19,380
( RUMBLING )

136
00:08:19,463 --> 00:08:20,923
( SNIFFING )

137
00:08:21,007 --> 00:08:22,049
( LAUGHING )

138
00:08:22,133 --> 00:08:24,677
Though Bosco seems to like him.

139
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:26,220
I'll hear what he has to say.

140
00:08:28,222 --> 00:08:31,350
AANG: Well, sir, there's a war
going on right now.

141
00:08:31,434 --> 00:08:33,644
For the past 100 years, in fact.

142
00:08:33,769 --> 00:08:35,938
The Dai Li's kept it secret from you.

143
00:08:36,063 --> 00:08:39,483
It's a conspiracy to control
the city and to control you.

144
00:08:39,567 --> 00:08:40,651
A secret war?

145
00:08:40,776 --> 00:08:42,403
That's crazy!

146
00:08:42,486 --> 00:08:43,487
Completely.

147
00:08:43,612 --> 00:08:45,990
Long Feng didn't want us to tell you,

148
00:08:46,073 --> 00:08:48,075
so he stole our sky bison to blackmail us.

149
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:50,202
And blackmail is the least of his crimes.

150
00:08:50,327 --> 00:08:52,204
He brainwashed our friend!

151
00:08:52,329 --> 00:08:53,664
All lies.

152
00:08:53,789 --> 00:08:56,500
I've never even seen
a sky bison, Your Majesty.

153
00:08:56,625 --> 00:08:59,170
Frankly, I thought they were extinct.

154
00:08:59,253 --> 00:09:00,921
Your claim is difficult to believe.

155
00:09:01,047 --> 00:09:02,965
Even from an Avatar.

156
00:09:03,090 --> 00:09:05,926
( WHISPERING ) These hooligans are part of
an anarchist cell

157
00:09:06,052 --> 00:09:08,804
that my legions have been
tracking for weeks.

158
00:09:08,888 --> 00:09:12,767
If you listen to them, you're playing
right into your own destruction.

159
00:09:15,227 --> 00:09:17,104
I have to trust my advisor.

160
00:09:21,192 --> 00:09:24,320
Wait, I can prove he's lying!

161
00:09:24,403 --> 00:09:27,114
Long Feng said he's never seen
a sky bison.

162
00:09:27,198 --> 00:09:28,532
Ask him to lift his robe.

163
00:09:28,616 --> 00:09:29,742
What?

164
00:09:29,825 --> 00:09:31,744
I am not disrobing.

165
00:09:36,874 --> 00:09:40,544
AANG: Right there, Appa bit him!

166
00:09:40,628 --> 00:09:43,214
Never met a sky bison, huh?

167
00:09:43,297 --> 00:09:46,258
That happens to be a large birthmark.

168
00:09:46,342 --> 00:09:48,469
Thanks for showing everyone.

169
00:09:48,552 --> 00:09:51,806
Well, I suppose there's no way to prove
where those marks came from.

170
00:09:51,889 --> 00:09:53,140
Of course there is.

171
00:09:53,224 --> 00:09:56,060
( RUMBLING )

172
00:09:58,604 --> 00:10:01,107
Yep, that pretty much proves it.

173
00:10:01,816 --> 00:10:03,400
( CHEERING )

174
00:10:04,443 --> 00:10:07,279
But it doesn't prove
this crazy conspiracy theory.

175
00:10:07,363 --> 00:10:08,739
( GROANING )

176
00:10:08,864 --> 00:10:12,409
Though, I suppose this matter
is worth looking into.

177
00:10:12,493 --> 00:10:16,122
KIDS: Uh, O.K., We'll take it,
uh, yeah, all right.

178
00:10:22,086 --> 00:10:23,337
( MOANING )

179
00:10:25,131 --> 00:10:27,007
You're burning up.

180
00:10:27,091 --> 00:10:29,218
You have an intense fever.

181
00:10:29,426 --> 00:10:31,804
This will help cool you down.

182
00:10:31,929 --> 00:10:33,597
So thirsty.

183
00:10:36,684 --> 00:10:39,061
Here's some clean water to drink.

184
00:10:39,145 --> 00:10:41,856
Stay under the blankets
and sweat this out.

185
00:10:53,492 --> 00:10:56,704
( COUGHING )

186
00:11:02,293 --> 00:11:05,254
So this is what a train is like.

187
00:11:05,379 --> 00:11:08,799
I didn't realize it would be
this... Public.

188
00:11:09,300 --> 00:11:12,344
So you've never been outside
the upper ring before?

189
00:11:12,428 --> 00:11:14,597
I've never been outside the palace.

190
00:11:14,805 --> 00:11:16,557
Now that's the way to travel.

191
00:11:19,143 --> 00:11:22,021
So, may I ask where we're going?

192
00:11:22,104 --> 00:11:24,857
Underneath Lake Laogai, Your Kingliness.

193
00:11:24,940 --> 00:11:26,567
To the Dai Li secret headquarters.

194
00:11:26,650 --> 00:11:28,068
You're about to see where all

195
00:11:28,152 --> 00:11:30,446
the brainwashing
and conspiring took place.

196
00:11:41,624 --> 00:11:43,167
TOPH: It's gone!

197
00:11:43,250 --> 00:11:46,003
Oh, don't tell me...

198
00:11:46,086 --> 00:11:48,881
That's O.K., Still got
my positive attitude.

199
00:11:49,006 --> 00:11:52,301
The Dai Li must have known we were coming
and destroyed the evidence.

200
00:11:52,384 --> 00:11:55,846
Hmm, that seems awfully convenient.

201
00:11:55,930 --> 00:12:00,476
Hey, if anything, this proves
the conspiracy exists even more.

202
00:12:00,559 --> 00:12:03,604
Long Feng was right,
this was a waste of time.

203
00:12:03,687 --> 00:12:07,524
If you'll excuse me,
I'm going back to the palace.

204
00:12:07,983 --> 00:12:08,984
The wall!

205
00:12:09,068 --> 00:12:11,278
They'll never be able to cover
that up in time.

206
00:12:11,362 --> 00:12:12,613
Oh, yeah.

207
00:12:14,281 --> 00:12:16,492
If you come with us to the outer wall,

208
00:12:16,575 --> 00:12:19,912
we can prove to you
that the secret war is real.

209
00:12:20,037 --> 00:12:22,915
No Earth King
has ever been to the outer wall.

210
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:27,002
I don't have any more time
for this nonsense.

211
00:12:27,086 --> 00:12:30,506
If you come with us, this time
you can ride on Appa.

212
00:12:30,965 --> 00:12:32,758
( RUMBLING )

213
00:12:33,133 --> 00:12:35,719
( SCREAMING )

214
00:12:36,136 --> 00:12:37,638
First time flying?

215
00:12:37,763 --> 00:12:40,474
It's both thrilling and terrifying.

216
00:12:40,599 --> 00:12:42,977
Yeah, I hate it, too.

217
00:12:43,060 --> 00:12:45,062
I have to be honest with you.

218
00:12:45,145 --> 00:12:48,774
Part of me really hopes that what you're
telling me about this war...

219
00:12:48,857 --> 00:12:50,192
Isn't true.

220
00:12:50,276 --> 00:12:51,610
I wish it wasn't.

221
00:12:55,406 --> 00:12:57,616
( GROANING )

222
00:13:03,872 --> 00:13:07,876
( FAINT CHANTING )

223
00:13:12,006 --> 00:13:13,841
GIRL: It's getting late.

224
00:13:13,924 --> 00:13:16,468
Are you planning to retire soon, My Lord?

225
00:13:17,344 --> 00:13:19,179
I'm not tired.

226
00:13:19,263 --> 00:13:20,973
GIRL: Relax, Fire Lord Zuko.

227
00:13:21,056 --> 00:13:22,683
Just let go.

228
00:13:22,766 --> 00:13:24,351
Give in to it.

229
00:13:24,435 --> 00:13:26,812
Shut your eyes for a while.

230
00:13:26,937 --> 00:13:29,440
UNCLE: No, Fire Lord Zuko!

231
00:13:29,565 --> 00:13:31,650
Do not listen to the blue dragon.

232
00:13:31,775 --> 00:13:34,445
You should get out of here right now.

233
00:13:34,528 --> 00:13:35,529
Go!

234
00:13:35,612 --> 00:13:38,615
Before it's too late!

235
00:13:38,741 --> 00:13:41,368
GIRL: Sleep now, Fire Lord Zuko.

236
00:13:54,048 --> 00:13:55,257
GIRL: Sleep.

237
00:13:55,382 --> 00:13:57,468
Just like mother!

238
00:13:59,386 --> 00:14:02,598
Zuko, help me!

239
00:14:02,723 --> 00:14:03,724
( SCREAMING )

240
00:14:09,521 --> 00:14:10,898
It's still there!

241
00:14:12,858 --> 00:14:14,151
What is that?

242
00:14:14,234 --> 00:14:15,277
It's a drill.

243
00:14:15,361 --> 00:14:17,821
A giant drill, made by the Fire Nation,

244
00:14:17,946 --> 00:14:20,115
to break through your walls.

245
00:14:24,411 --> 00:14:27,539
I can't believe I never knew.

246
00:14:28,957 --> 00:14:31,293
I can explain this, Your Majesty.

247
00:14:31,377 --> 00:14:32,961
This is nothing more than...

248
00:14:33,087 --> 00:14:34,880
A construction project.

249
00:14:34,963 --> 00:14:36,173
Really?

250
00:14:36,256 --> 00:14:38,550
Then perhaps you could explain why there's

251
00:14:38,634 --> 00:14:41,637
a Fire Nation insignia on
your construction project.

252
00:14:43,430 --> 00:14:45,557
Well, it's imported, of course.

253
00:14:45,641 --> 00:14:48,852
You know you can't trust
domestic machinery.

254
00:14:51,188 --> 00:14:54,900
Surely you don't believe these children
instead of your most loyal attendant?

255
00:15:01,949 --> 00:15:04,535
Dai Li, arrest Long Feng.

256
00:15:04,618 --> 00:15:07,913
I want him to stand trial for crimes
against the Earth Kingdom.

257
00:15:18,257 --> 00:15:20,008
You can't arrest me.

258
00:15:20,092 --> 00:15:22,344
You all need me more than you know!

259
00:15:22,428 --> 00:15:25,222
Looks like Long Feng is long gone!

260
00:15:25,305 --> 00:15:26,974
Ha...

261
00:15:27,057 --> 00:15:29,143
Oh, yeah, I've been waitin'
to use that one.

262
00:15:35,107 --> 00:15:37,025
KING: I want to thank you, young heroes,

263
00:15:37,109 --> 00:15:39,027
for opening my eyes.

264
00:15:39,111 --> 00:15:42,906
All this time, what I thought was a great
metropolis was merely a city of fools.

265
00:15:43,824 --> 00:15:46,702
And that makes me the king fool.

266
00:15:46,785 --> 00:15:48,036
( RUMBLING )

267
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:50,956
We're at war with the Fire Nation.

268
00:15:51,039 --> 00:15:53,834
SOKKA: That's why we came
to Ba Sing Se, Your Highness.

269
00:15:53,917 --> 00:15:56,295
Because we think
you could help us end the war.

270
00:15:56,378 --> 00:15:58,380
AANG: We don't have much time.

271
00:15:58,464 --> 00:16:00,174
There's a comet coming this summer.

272
00:16:00,257 --> 00:16:03,594
Its energy will give the firebenders
unbelievable strength.

273
00:16:03,677 --> 00:16:05,304
They'll be unstoppable.

274
00:16:05,429 --> 00:16:06,763
But there is hope.

275
00:16:06,889 --> 00:16:09,766
Before the comet comes,
we have a window of opportunity.

276
00:16:09,892 --> 00:16:11,977
A solar eclipse is coming.

277
00:16:12,060 --> 00:16:14,396
The sun will be entirely
blocked out by the moon,

278
00:16:14,521 --> 00:16:16,773
and the firebenders will be helpless.

279
00:16:16,857 --> 00:16:18,400
What are you suggesting, Sokka?

280
00:16:18,484 --> 00:16:22,237
That's the day we need to invade
the Fire Nation.

281
00:16:22,321 --> 00:16:25,449
The day of black sun.

282
00:16:25,532 --> 00:16:26,867
I don't know.

283
00:16:26,950 --> 00:16:29,369
That would require
moving troops out of Ba Sing Se.

284
00:16:29,453 --> 00:16:31,455
We'd be completely vulnerable.

285
00:16:31,538 --> 00:16:33,749
You're already vulnerable.

286
00:16:33,832 --> 00:16:37,461
The Fire Nation won't stop
until Ba Sing Se falls.

287
00:16:37,544 --> 00:16:40,714
You can either sit back
and wait for that to happen,

288
00:16:40,797 --> 00:16:44,384
or take the offensive and give
yourself a fighting chance.

289
00:16:47,971 --> 00:16:49,431
Very well.

290
00:16:49,515 --> 00:16:50,807
You have my support.

291
00:16:50,891 --> 00:16:55,062
( CHEERING )

292
00:16:55,145 --> 00:16:56,813
MAN: Your Majesty.

293
00:16:58,482 --> 00:17:01,443
I apologize for the interruption.

294
00:17:01,527 --> 00:17:03,111
KING: This is General How.

295
00:17:03,195 --> 00:17:07,407
He's the leader of the Council of Five,
my highest-ranking generals.

296
00:17:08,283 --> 00:17:09,785
We searched Long Feng's office.

297
00:17:09,868 --> 00:17:14,248
I think we found something
that will interest everybody.

298
00:17:15,207 --> 00:17:19,253
There are secret files
on everyone in Ba Sing Se.

299
00:17:19,336 --> 00:17:20,587
Including you kids.

300
00:17:20,671 --> 00:17:22,256
Secret files?

301
00:17:22,339 --> 00:17:23,924
KING: Toph Beifong.

302
00:17:27,177 --> 00:17:28,554
It's a letter from your mom.

303
00:17:28,679 --> 00:17:30,764
Your mom's here in the city.

304
00:17:30,847 --> 00:17:32,975
And she wants to see you.

305
00:17:33,058 --> 00:17:35,727
Long Feng intercepted
our letters from home?

306
00:17:35,852 --> 00:17:36,937
That's just sad.

307
00:17:37,062 --> 00:17:38,480
KING: Aang.

308
00:17:38,564 --> 00:17:43,151
This scroll was attached to the horn of
your bison when the Dai Li captured it.

309
00:17:43,235 --> 00:17:46,446
It's from the Eastern Air Temple.

310
00:17:46,530 --> 00:17:51,577
Is there a letter for me
and Sokka, by any chance?

311
00:17:51,702 --> 00:17:52,703
I'm afraid not.

312
00:17:54,663 --> 00:17:55,706
Oh.

313
00:17:55,789 --> 00:17:59,126
But there is an intelligence
report that might interest you.

314
00:17:59,459 --> 00:18:01,712
A small fleet of water tribe ships?

315
00:18:01,795 --> 00:18:02,963
What?

316
00:18:03,046 --> 00:18:04,381
That could be Dad!

317
00:18:04,464 --> 00:18:06,383
Protecting the mouth of Chameleon Bay?

318
00:18:06,842 --> 00:18:09,428
Led by Hakoda, it is Dad!

319
00:18:12,097 --> 00:18:15,475
UNCLE: You should know
this is not a natural sickness.

320
00:18:15,559 --> 00:18:19,771
But that shouldn't stop you
from enjoying tea.

321
00:18:19,855 --> 00:18:21,356
What, what's happening?

322
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:25,986
Your critical decision,
what you did beneath that lake,

323
00:18:26,069 --> 00:18:29,906
it was in such conflict
with your image of yourself

324
00:18:29,990 --> 00:18:35,162
that you are now at war
within your own mind and body.

325
00:18:35,245 --> 00:18:36,830
What's that mean?

326
00:18:36,913 --> 00:18:39,875
( COUGHING )

327
00:18:39,958 --> 00:18:43,629
You're going through
a metamorphosis, my nephew.

328
00:18:43,712 --> 00:18:46,590
It will not be a pleasant experience.

329
00:18:46,673 --> 00:18:48,925
But when you come out of it,

330
00:18:49,009 --> 00:18:52,679
you will be the beautiful prince
you were always meant to be.

331
00:18:54,931 --> 00:18:56,433
AANG: I can't believe it.

332
00:18:56,516 --> 00:18:59,019
There's a man living at
the Eastern Air Temple.

333
00:18:59,102 --> 00:19:00,354
He says he's a guru.

334
00:19:00,437 --> 00:19:03,231
What's a guru?
Some kind of poisonous blowfish?

335
00:19:03,357 --> 00:19:05,651
No, a spiritual expert.

336
00:19:05,734 --> 00:19:08,779
He wants to help me take the next step in
the Avatar journey.

337
00:19:08,862 --> 00:19:11,323
He says he can teach me
to control the Avatar state.

338
00:19:11,531 --> 00:19:14,493
And I can't believe
we know where our dad is now.

339
00:19:14,576 --> 00:19:15,744
I know what you mean.

340
00:19:15,827 --> 00:19:17,621
My mom's in the city,

341
00:19:17,704 --> 00:19:20,999
and from her letter, it sounds like she
finally understands me.

342
00:19:21,083 --> 00:19:23,377
This is all such big news.

343
00:19:23,460 --> 00:19:24,836
Where do we even start?

344
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,963
I hate to say it, but...

345
00:19:27,047 --> 00:19:28,507
We have to split up.

346
00:19:28,590 --> 00:19:29,966
Split up?

347
00:19:30,050 --> 00:19:32,511
We just found Appa and got
the family back together.

348
00:19:32,594 --> 00:19:35,138
Now you want us to separate?

349
00:19:35,263 --> 00:19:37,516
You have to meet this guru, Aang.

350
00:19:37,599 --> 00:19:42,020
If we're gonna invade
the Fire Nation, you need to be ready.

351
00:19:42,104 --> 00:19:44,481
Well, if I'm going to
the Eastern Air Temple,

352
00:19:44,564 --> 00:19:47,442
Appa and I can drop you off at
Chameleon Bay to see your dad.

353
00:19:47,526 --> 00:19:49,611
Someone has to stay here with
the Earth King

354
00:19:49,695 --> 00:19:51,363
and help him plan for the invasion.

355
00:19:51,446 --> 00:19:52,531
I guess that's me.

356
00:19:52,614 --> 00:19:55,951
No, Sokka, I know how badly
you want to help Dad.

357
00:19:56,034 --> 00:19:59,621
You go to Chameleon Bay,
I'll stay here with the king.

358
00:19:59,705 --> 00:20:01,832
You are the...

359
00:20:01,915 --> 00:20:04,751
Nicest... Sister... Ever!

360
00:20:04,835 --> 00:20:06,670
( KISSING )

361
00:20:06,753 --> 00:20:08,547
Easy there, big brother.

362
00:20:08,630 --> 00:20:10,090
Though you're right, I am.

363
00:20:16,972 --> 00:20:20,225
AANG: Katara, I need to
tell you something.

364
00:20:20,809 --> 00:20:22,936
I've been wanting to say it
for a long time.

365
00:20:23,019 --> 00:20:24,104
What is it, Aang?

366
00:20:24,187 --> 00:20:26,398
Katara, I...

367
00:20:26,481 --> 00:20:27,899
All right!

368
00:20:27,983 --> 00:20:32,237
Who's ready to get going on
a little men-only, man trip?

369
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:35,782
Aang and Sokka, I wish you a good journey.

370
00:20:35,866 --> 00:20:37,951
Ba Sing Se owes you its thanks.

371
00:20:38,034 --> 00:20:41,163
And we look forward to your safe return.

372
00:20:42,164 --> 00:20:45,417
GUARD: Your Majesty, there are three
female warriors here to see you.

373
00:20:45,500 --> 00:20:47,127
They're from the island of Kyoshi.

374
00:20:47,210 --> 00:20:48,420
That's Suki!

375
00:20:48,503 --> 00:20:50,922
( SCREAMING )

376
00:20:51,006 --> 00:20:52,424
You know these warriors?

377
00:20:52,507 --> 00:20:53,550
Oh, yeah.

378
00:20:53,633 --> 00:20:56,219
The Kyoshi Warriors
are a skilled group of fighters.

379
00:20:56,303 --> 00:20:57,304
Trustworthy, too.

380
00:20:57,387 --> 00:20:59,556
They're good friends of ours.

381
00:21:00,390 --> 00:21:04,019
Then we shall welcome them
as honored guests.

382
00:21:04,102 --> 00:21:05,979
KATARA: Wait, Aang.

383
00:21:08,732 --> 00:21:11,485
( KISSING )

384
00:21:11,568 --> 00:21:13,570
TOPH: I'm really gonna miss you guys.

385
00:21:13,653 --> 00:21:16,364
KATARA: Me, too.
AANG: Yeah.

386
00:21:18,408 --> 00:21:19,659
( SCREAMING )

387
00:21:19,785 --> 00:21:21,870
Great, that's enough.

388
00:21:21,995 --> 00:21:23,914
O.K., We love each other.

389
00:21:24,039 --> 00:21:25,040
Seriously.

390
00:21:25,373 --> 00:21:27,959
( RUMBLING )

391
00:21:47,103 --> 00:21:49,981
( SCREAMING )

392
00:21:50,065 --> 00:21:51,358
( GASPING )

393
00:22:01,910 --> 00:22:03,954
SOKKA: You see, Aang?

394
00:22:04,037 --> 00:22:05,997
A little positive thinking works wonders.

395
00:22:06,081 --> 00:22:09,042
We got the king on our side,
we got Long Feng arrested,

396
00:22:09,125 --> 00:22:11,628
and when we get back,
Suki's waiting for me.

397
00:22:11,711 --> 00:22:13,004
Yeah.

398
00:22:13,088 --> 00:22:14,798
Girls are waiting for us.

399
00:22:14,881 --> 00:22:17,050
Thanks, positive attitude.

400
00:22:17,133 --> 00:22:19,719
Everything is gonna work out perfectly.

401
00:22:19,803 --> 00:22:21,596
From now on and forever.

402
00:22:30,313 --> 00:22:31,982
MAN: Dinner.

403
00:22:32,107 --> 00:22:35,819
The Council of Five and the military
are loyal to the Earth King.

404
00:22:35,902 --> 00:22:41,408
But the Dai Li remains loyal
to you, Long Feng, sir.

405
00:22:49,749 --> 00:22:51,501
( SIGHING )

406
00:22:55,589 --> 00:22:58,174
Hello, Mom?

407
00:22:58,258 --> 00:23:00,844
Anyone home?

408
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:05,265
( SCREAMING )

409
00:23:05,390 --> 00:23:07,058
Hey!

410
00:23:07,183 --> 00:23:09,644
Who do you think you're dealing with?

411
00:23:09,769 --> 00:23:15,483
One loudmouthed little brat
who strayed too far from home.

412
00:23:24,159 --> 00:23:25,994
KING: In our hour of need,

413
00:23:26,077 --> 00:23:29,205
it is with the highest honor that I
welcome our esteemed allies,

414
00:23:29,289 --> 00:23:31,041
the Kyoshi Warriors.

415
00:23:32,626 --> 00:23:36,129
We are the Earth King's humble servants.
